@host = http://localhost:5205

### Sign in as the admin created from appsettings.Development.json.
### The auth cookie is kept by the client for the requests below
### (REST Client for VS Code does this; if your client does not, use the browser UI instead).
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Who am I?
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

### Create a vehicle (admin). Types: motorbike, car, van, truck
# @name vehicle
POST {{host}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plate": "34 ABC 123",
  "type": "van",
  "capacityKg": 1200
}

### Create a courier together with their login (admin)
# @name courier
POST {{host}}/api/couriers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kemal Yıldız",
  "phone": "0532 111 22 33",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicle.response.body.$.id}}",
  "username": "kemal",
  "password": "Kurye1234!"
}

### Create a shipment (admin). "ownerUsername" links it to a customer account (optional).
# @name shipment
POST {{host}}/api/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderName": "Ayşe Yılmaz",
  "receiverName": "Mehmet Demir",
  "receiverPhone": "0532 000 00 00",
  "originCity": "İstanbul",
  "destinationCity": "Burdur",
  "weightKg": 2.5
}

### Hand the shipment to the courier (admin). Refused when the vehicle cannot carry the weight.
PUT {{host}}/api/shipments/{{shipment.response.body.$.trackingNumber}}/courier
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courierId": "{{courier.response.body.$.id}}"
}

### Add a movement (admin, or the assigned courier)
POST {{host}}/api/shipments/{{shipment.response.body.$.trackingNumber}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InTransit",
  "location": "Ankara Aktarma Merkezi",
  "note": "Transfer merkezinden çıktı."
}

### List with search, filter and paging. Everything is optional.
GET {{host}}/api/shipments?q=ankara&status=InTransit&page=1&pageSize=10

### Dashboard numbers
GET {{host}}/api/shipments/stats

### Edit a shipment (admin)
PUT {{host}}/api/shipments/{{shipment.response.body.$.trackingNumber}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderName": "Ayşe Yılmaz",
  "receiverName": "Mehmet Demir",
  "receiverPhone": "0532 000 00 00",
  "originCity": "İstanbul",
  "destinationCity": "Isparta",
  "weightKg": 3
}

### Delete a shipment (admin)
DELETE {{host}}/api/shipments/{{shipment.response.body.$.trackingNumber}}

### Public tracking lookup (no sign-in needed)
GET {{host}}/api/track/KT0000000000

### Sign out
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
